    {
      "url": "https://gonouniversity.edu.bd/bba/about/why-bba-at-gb/",
      "title": "Why BBA at GB - Department of Business Administration",
      "department": "Department of Business Administration",
      "type": "administration",
      "publishedAt": "",
      "modifiedAt": "2024-11-25T06:35:47+00:00",
      "headings": [
        "Department of Business Administration",
        "Why BBA at GB",
        "Why Bachelor of Business Administration at GB",
        "Related Links",
        "Notice",
        "Approved BY",
        "Quick Links",
        "Notices",
        "Contact Us"
      ],
      "chunks": [
        "Why Bachelor of Business Administration at GB\nChoose us we will help to choose your future.\nWe are the Department of Business Administration of Gono Bishwabidyalay family. Our motto is to provide highest quality outcome based education not only to equip our students with business knowledge, skill, and understanding needed for a successful career in constantly changing business environment but also prepare them to help the society through development of root level entrepreneurship and business. We encourage our students to become an independent thinker, self-reflecting individuals and capable to meet the demands of employers and society in the business world. We offer wide range of business courses like Finance and banking, Accounting, Marketing and Management, Business research to provide the depth knowledge of Business studies that will help our students for their further study, training and career. Beside this, we include unique courses like Bengali, Gender studies, Business Ethics, Freedom Struggle and Gonoshastho Kendra, and Environmental Studies of Bangladesh in our programs to help our student to become socially responsible entrepreneurs and business personnel.",
        "Our qualified devoted faculty members are our strength who are always ready to help our students with the best up to date knowledge in business area.\nOur course design offer the opportunities for our students to develop their skills, techniques and personal attributes essential for success in domestic business environment along with the knowledge and understanding of international business operations, opportunities and challenges presented by a globalized market place.\nAs a part of Gono Bishwabidyalay, a community based Organization we are also committed to the well-being of our society, which inspire us to offer our students knowledge of our great liberation war, culturally diverse organizations, cross-cultural issues, diversity and values."
      ]
    },
