      "chunks": [
        "Mission & Vision\nMission:\nThe mission of the Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering (EEE) is to encourage young minds to acquire knowledge for building up technical experts by delivering top quality education. This will allow them to solve real world problems via innovative research and to engage in effective regional, national and international service and outreach.\nVision:\nThe vision of the Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering (EEE) is:\nTo be well recognized regionally and internationally for excellence in its educational programs, pioneering research activities and in full compliance to the international standards of quality assurance.\nTo prepare students to become the most talented, competent and caring electrical engineers who are in great demand in the electrical sectors of Bangladesh.\nTo create international standard skills in Electrical and Electronic Engineering and related fields through innovative ideas and by providing world class education.\nTo produce electrical and electronic engineering technologists with practical knowledge and employability skills that contributes to the economic development and welfare of the society."
      ]
