        "Lab Facility\nLaboratory Facilities\nThe Department has the following well equipped and state of the art Laboratories.\nEngineering Physics\nElectronics\nDigital Electronics\nPower and Industrial Electronics\nDigital Signal Processing\nBasic Mechanical Engineering\nElectrical Circuits\nElectrical Machines\nElectrical and Electronic Circuit Simulation\nElectrical Measurement & Instrumentation\nComputer Programming Technique\nCommunication Engineering Theory\nMicroprocessors, Microcontrollers & Peripherals\nControl System Engineering\nInternet of Things (IoT)\nRobotics Club\nThe robotics club of EEE has been established to promote co-curricular activities. The registrar of Gono Bishwabidyalay inaugurated this club on 12th July of 2018. A training course on “Embedded System and Robotics” is organized by this club."
