        "Contact Us"
      ],
      "chunks": [
        "Students who became alumni by now have been serving in the various sectors of Administration, Education, Business and Private offices. A comprehensive survey may demonstrate the achievement of the entity within these two decades introduced with the idea of English for specific purposes (ESP). The entity Department of English hence integrated within its curriculum, the concentration on ELT and the concentration on English Literature, besides the communicative syllabus for extra-departmental students.\nDuring the last two decades, linguistic studies have expanded tremendously all over the world, at the same time English literature study also gained substantial sophistication, along with the global demand for textual material to make the students familiar with Post-modern literary creativity. The curriculum was designed to have the vision of the changing demand of English. Thanks to their futuristic vision, we could see the curriculum of Introduction to Linguistics, Introduction of Psycholinguistics, Sociolinguistics, Translation Studies, Critical Theory, Studies in Classics."
      ]
    },
