        "Welcome Message from the Department Head\nWelcome to the Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering offers B.Sc. (Engg.)\nThe Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering offers B.Sc. (Engg.) degree in Electrical and Electronic Engineering which is one of the most dynamic and fast-growing department of Gono Bishwabidyalay (GB). Electrical engineering is the study of electric power distribution, motors and generators. Electronic engineering is the study of robotics, communications, circuits, electromagnetic fields and digital and analog hardware. Students will receive a thorough grounding in mathematics, physics, chemistry, computer science and engineering science during their first four semesters. The curriculum is based on providing a sound engineering background with digital class room. The aims of the Department undergraduate studies for the B.Sc. in EEE at Gono Bishwabidyalay are\nTo produce engineers equipped with the technical knowledge and skills in both theoretical and practical in the area of power, electronic and communication engineering with the ability to apply them correctly, efficiently and creatively.",
        "To enhance students’ power-electronic-and communication skills and their ability to use knowledge in a rapidly changing world.\nTo produce socially responsible, morally upright scientists and engineers.\nProfessor Dr. Palash Chandra Karmakera\nHead of the Dept. (Acting)\nDepartment of Electrical and Electronic Engineering\nGono Bishwabidyalay (Gono)"
      ]
    },
