        "Mission & Vision\nMission\nThe mission of the department of Chemistry and Physics are as under:\nTo make quality teachers and scholars expected to render commendable contribution in the arena of national and global education.\nTo develop sound knowledge on science so as to get it applied efficiently and effectively in own field as well as other science and engineering disciplines where required.\nVision\nKeeping the motto “A University with a difference” in view, the vision of the department of Chemistry and Physics is as under:\nTo create a combined platform for the teachers/scholars and master’s students (future expansion) to conduct research in Chemistry and Physics with available resources and financial support of CMR, GB, in our own perspectives, and also in collaboration with AEC, BUET, JU, RU, DU and other renowned universities/organization of Bangladesh and abroad under MoU."
