        "Welcome Message from the Department Head\nWelcome to the Department of Applied Mathematics. In the era of present globalization, there is an immense importance of study of the Applied Mathematics. Application of Mathematics is being used in all aspects of life including jobs, business, economic and social processes. Like many other developing nations, the benefits of Applied Mathematics in Bangladesh will be further extended. The demand of Applied Mathematics is consequently increasing all over the world besides Bangladesh.\nDr. Wahida Zaman Loskor\nProfessor & Head of the Dept.\nDepartment of Applied Mathematics\nGono Bishwabidyalay"
      ]
