      "chunks": [
        "Course Plan\nCourse Plane:\nThe Gono Bishwabidyalay is the pioneer to launch a four-year graduate program in Applied Mathematics and is divided into 8 (eight) semester, each with 6 (six) months duration. Semester final examination will be held at the end of each semester for the completion of the semester. The recommended course of the program has to be completed by a student over within a maximum period of 12 (twelve) consecutive semesters.This will offer the most rewarding and exciting career for prospective students. The reason for the introduction of this new program is to provide sufficient mathematical and computational knowledge and their applications to the students, specially the girl students of the middle and lower income group for their upliftment and carrier opportunities in schools, business houses, financial and academic institutions.\nTuition Fee: 1,50,000 (2017-2018)"
      ]
