      "chunks": [
        "Professor Dr. Md. Salahuddin\nProfessor & Head of the Department\nDepartment of Medical Physics & Biomedical Engineering\nGono Bishwabidyalay (Gono)\nWelcome Message from the Departmental Head\nWelcome to the Department of Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering at Gono Bishwabidyalay.\nMedical Physics and Biomedical Engineering is an interdisciplinary field that brings together physics, engineering, biology, as well as medicine to address the evolving needs of modern hospital and healthcare sectors. With rapid advances in medical technology, the role of professionals in this field has become increasingly important in medical imaging, radiation therapy, healthcare instrumentation, biomedical devices, patient safety and cancer research.\nAt the Department of Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering, we are committed to providing a high-quality education which combines strong theoretical foundations along with the practical and research-oriented learning. Our academic programs are designed to develop students’ scientific knowledge, technical competence, analytical thinking, innovation, and professional ethics.",
        "Our vision is to establish Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering department as a center of excellence in education, research, and innovation in Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering. We are also committed to contributing to the advancement of healthcare technology in Bangladesh and beyond through knowledge, research, collaboration, and service to society.\nI warmly invite students, researchers, healthcare professionals, and prospective collaborators to explore our department and become part of our academic community.\nTogether, let us advance science and technology for a healthier and better future.\nHead\nDepartment of Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering\nGono Bishwabidyalay"
      ]
