        "Computer Programming Laboratory\nThe Computer Programming Lab is equipped with desktop computers (36) and multimedia projectors.\nAll the PCs have advanced configurations.\nThe lab provides a range of software to support lab classes and research works in the broad field of Software Systems including programming, database management systems, information system design, software engineering, computer networking, and high-performance simulation and modeling.\nThere are 24 hours dedicated 30 mbps internet connections.\nWiFi Service is also available for the students.\nThe lab room is fully monitored with CCTV cameras.\nMicro-Processor Laboratory\nThis lab is equipped with a sufficient Oscilloscope, Panel Board (6), Bread Board (10), Trainer Board, DC Power Supply (2), Functional Generator (2), Digital and Analog Trainer Board, and a huge collection of different ICs.\nComputer Fundamental Laboratory\nThis lab is equipped with desktop computers (22) and multimedia projectors.\nAll the PCs have advanced configurations (Core i3 to Core 2 Quad processor).\nThe lab provides a range of software to support the students with their basic knowledge of computer systems."
