        "Welcome to the Department of Microbiology\nWe offer dynamic, career-focused programs — a 4-years B.Sc. (Honours) and a 1-year M.S. (Master’s) — designed to prepare students for exciting opportunities in research, healthcare, industry, agriculture, and environmental sciences. Our curriculum blends a deep understanding of microorganisms and their role in nature with hands-on applications in solving real-world problems.\nWho Can Apply?\nStudents from the Science group who have completed Biology, Chemistry, Physics, and Mathematics in their Higher Secondary Certificate (HSC) or equivalent are eligible to join our programs.\nWhy Choose Us?\nSelective Admission: 50 undergraduate students per semester and 20 graduate students annually.\nExpert Faculty: 11 highly qualified and experienced teachers from leading national and private institutions.\nDistinguished Guests: Eminent guest professors enrich the learning experience with advanced expertise.\nResearch & Innovation: Strong focus on modern microbiology, from molecular biology to industrial applications.",
        "Here, you will not only gain knowledge but also develop the skills, curiosity, and confidence to thrive in a world where microbiology shapes the future."
