        "Profile\nBulbul Ahmed\nLecturer\nQualification: B.Sc. (Hons), M.S. in Chemistry (JU)\nMobile: 01943236328\nE-mail: sky.bulbulahmed@gmail.com\nShort Biography\nEducation\nExperiences\nAdministrative Services\nPublications\nGrants\nEditorial Board/Reviewer\nConferences\nTraining\nMembership\nAwards and Achievements\nBulbul Ahmed was born in Meherpur, Bangladesh. He earned his Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) degree in Chemistry in 2020 (Examination held in 2022) and Master of Science (M.S.) degree with a thesis in Chemistry in 2021 (Examination held in 2023-24) from Jahangirnagar University (JU), Dhaka, Bangladesh. Mr. Ahmed is currently conducting research under the supervision of Prof. Dr. Md. Anamul Hoque, a prominent academic and researcher in the Department of Chemistry at Jahangirnagar University. His research interests encompass Physical and Biophysical Chemistry, with a particular focus on the interactions of drugs, dyes, polymers, and biomolecules with surfactants. Additionally, he is also interested in Medicinal Chemistry, specifically in drug discovery and development.\n2021\nMaster of Science (M.S.) in Chemistry\n• Jahangirnagar University\n2020\nBachelor of Science (B.Sc.) in Chemistry",
