        "Existing organizations where our students are working\nStudents who have passed from Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering department, they are working as medical physicists and biomedical engineers in many government and private hospitals such as- Bangabandhu Sheikh Mujib Medical University (BSMMU), National Institute of Cancer Research and Hospital (NICRH), Dhaka Medical College and Hospital (DMCH), Combined Military Hospital (CMH), United Hospitals Ltd (UHL), Square Hospital, KhwajaYunus Ali Medical College and Hospital (KYMCH), Ahsania Mission Cancer and General Hospital (AMCGH), Rajshahi Medical College and Hospital (RMCH), Gonoshasthaya Hospital, North East Medical College Hospital (NEMCH), Sheikh Fazilatunnesa Mujib Memorial Specialized Hospital, Enam Medical College and Hospital (EMCH), Barishal Medical College Hospital, Delta Hospital, Labaid Hospital, Apollo Hospital, various government and private universities such as MIST, Gono Bishwabidyalay and North East University, Medical equipment providing companies such as- Trade vision, Trade house, Alive line, Health Pack and Health Care, Famantec and etc.\nProspective Areas",
        "The following institutions have job opportunities for medical physicists:\nGovernment or private hospitals or clinics\nRadiotherapy departments providing cancer treatments\nDiagnostic centers\nBangladesh Atomic Energy Commission\nBCSIR\nMultinational companies providing medical equipments\nEducational institutions, polytehnique institutes and research institutes\nSc and M.Sc degree holders have the opportunities to attend in BCS and work in various government and private institutes\nMedical physics and biomedical engineering degree holders have high demands in foreign countries"
