      "chunks": [
        "Message From Dean\nWelcome to the faculty of Veterinary & Animal Sciences, Gono Bishwabidyalay. The faculty was established in 2016. The faculty intends to educate students with the necessary knowledge of Veterinary & Animal sciences and helps them to be skilled to enter any research or institutions of the related fields. Now, a number of students are studying in the BSc (Vet Sc & AH) programs. We have sufficient number of sincere, proactive, enthusiastic, energetic and experienced faculty members from different national and international institutions/universities.We have also some brilliant and renowned/eminent visiting/guest professors, whose engagement justifies our commitment to quality education. All faculty members are actively engaged in research and professional activities. We are committed to promote high quality education and research with the maximum use of our facilities. In addition, we collaborate with other laboratories of different universities and research institutions for conducting research for our students. I invite brilliant, young, motivated students to join our faculty and to take advantages of our benevolent facilities for a promising career in veterinary & animal sciences."
