      "chunks": [
        "Requirements for Admission:\nDepartment of Business Administration is promised to provide standard education. Candidates are selected for admission on the basis of results in the admission test and the GPA obtained in public examinations. To be eligible for admission in BBA program of GB, a candidate must pass SSC and HSC examinations or its equivalent in any discipline. A candidate who has passed HSC or equivalent examination in the current year or a year before is allowed to apply. However, the candidates must obtain the minimum GPA of 3.5 in both SSC/equivalent and 3.25 in HSC/equivalent and collective GPA of 7.0. The candidates should have A-(minus) grade in Mathematics if they are from science background and B grade in Mathematics/Economics/Accounting/Business Principles and Practices if they are from other background. It should be noted that from the both background they have at least B in English.\nMedium of Instruction & Examination\nThe medium of instruction and answer in the examination scripts shall be in English."
      ]
