        "Program Requirements\nAdmission Requirement for B.Sc (Engg.) in EEE Program\nStudents seeking admission for the degree of Bachelor of Electrical and Electronic Engineering should be passed both the S.S.C and H.S.C examinations with at least GPA 2.5 (Scale 5) or 2nd Class in each of the examinations.\nStudents passing Electrical Technology and Electronic Technology from Polytechnique Institute with a GPA of at least 2.5 (Scale 5) or 2nd Class are also eligible for admission into the B.Sc (Engg.) in EEE course."
