        "Program Requirements\nUniversity follows the rules and regulations of Bangladesh University Grand Commission (UGC) for students admission. Minimum requirement to apply for admission is GPA 2.5 both in SSC and HSC examinations. In case of GPA 2.00 in any examination, the students must have at least GPA 6.00 in total of both SSC and HSC examinaiton. Only 50 students will have the opportunity to get admitted in each semester. Candidates are selected for admission on the basis of results in the admission test and the GPA obtained in the public examinations."
