        "Department of Microbiology\nWelcome to the Department of Microbiology, Gono Bishwabidyalay. The department established in 1998 under the faculty of Health and Medical Science intends to educate students with the necessary knowledge of biological science and helps them to be skilled to enter any research or industrial institutions of the related fields. The department offers a full-time 4-year B.Sc. (Hon’s) program in Microbiology. In this curriculum, principal emphasis is placed on understanding microorganisms and their interrelationships with other organisms in nature, the application of microbiology in health and medicine, environment, agriculture and industry, and the study of fundamental life processes as exemplified by microorganisms.",
        "At present, We receive 50 students per semester at the undergraduate level. We have a large number of sincere, enthusiastic, energetic and experienced faculty members from different national and international universities. We have also some eminent visiting guest professors, whose engagement justifies our commitment to quality education. All faculty members are actively engaged in research and professional activities. We are committed to promoting high-quality education and research with the maximum use of our facilities. In addition, we collaborate our research and teaching activities with other laboratories of different universities and research institutions for graduate and undergraduate students. We cordially invite brilliant, young, motivated students to join our department and to take advantage of our benevolent facilities for a promising career in microbiology."
      ]
