      "chunks": [
        "Why Choose Microbiology at GB?\nWe prepare you for high-demand positions in academia, top national research laboratories and industry like icddr,b, SQUARE Pharmaceuticals, BCSIR, NIB, WASA etc.\nWe are firmly dedicated in our research and academic endeavors to creating and sustaining a nurturing, inclusive and welcoming environment for all.\nWe foster a collaborative, collegial environment and are dedicated to your professional development. Our faculty will mentor you throughout your studies.\nYou will work in our department facilities and faculty labs — all equipped with the tools to tackle new problems in microbiology and immunology.\nYou will build your skill set using a wide variety of modern molecular techniques — all tailored to the specific needs of your research.\nYou will have opportunities to build expertise across disciplines, learning from renowned faculties in infectious disease medicine, bioinformatics, cancer immunology and interrelated fields.\nWe engage you in various research activities through laboratory works guided by renowned faculties."
      ]
