        "Profile\nMohammad Asif Chowdhury\nAssistant Professor\nQualification: M.A. in International Relations, Jahangirnagar University\nMobile: 01 8163 3 3168\nE-mail: asif.pg.gb@gmail.com\nShort Biography\nEducation\nExperiences\nAdministrative Services\nPublications\nGrants\nEditorial Board/Reviewer\nConferences\nTraining\nMembership\nAwards and Achievements\n[wonderplugin_pdf src=”https://gonouniversity.edu.bd/politics/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/CV-of-MOHAMMAD-ASIF-CHOWDHURY-2019-PRC.pdf” width=”100%” height=”600px” style=”border:0;”]\nBooklet\n1. Founding of International Relations Department at Jahangirnagar University [in Bangla], Centre for International Affairs, Jahangirnagar University, Dhaka, 2008\n2. Sources of Anti-Indianism in Bangladesh [in Bangla], Centre for International Affairs, Gono Bishwabidyalay, Dhaka, 2017"
