        "Profile\nMahmudul Hasan\nAssistant Professor\nQualification: B.Sc. (Hon's) (GB), M.Sc. in Microbiology (HSTU)\nMobile: 01761997615\nE-mail: mhmasud1993@gmail.com\nShort Biography\nEducation\nExperiences\nAdministrative Services\nPublications\nGrants\nEditorial Board/Reviewer\nConferences\nTraining\nMembership\nAwards and Achievements\nMahmudul Hasan Masud is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Microbiology at Gono Bishwabidyalay (University). He joined the university as a Lecturer in September 2019 and has been serving as an Assistant Professor since July 2025. He completed his B.Sc. (Honours) in Microbiology from Gono Bishwabidyalay and his M.S. in Microbiology from Hajee Mohammad Danesh Science and Technology University with.",
        "His academic and research interests include molecular microbiology, antimicrobial resistance, infectious diseases, bioinformatics, and public health microbiology. His research experience includes the isolation and characterization of antimicrobial-resistant bacteria, investigation of food- and water-borne pathogens, and molecular and computational approaches to microbial research. He has published research articles in national and international journals and has experience in teaching, laboratory research, student supervision, and scientific writing.\n1. Master of Science (MS) in Microbiology\nInstitute: Hajee Mohammad Danesh Science and Technology University, 2016–2017\nThesis: Isolation and characterization of multiple drug- resistant bacteria from the waste of hospital and non-hospital environments.\nKey coursework: Molecular Biology, Virology, Immunology\n2. Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) in Microbiology\nInstitute: Gono Bishwabidyalay (University), 2012–2016\nThesis Project: Isolation and Identification of Common Food-borne Pathogens from Honey and Determination of Antimicrobial Activity of Honey in Greater Dhaka Region, Bangladesh.",
        "Key coursework: Biotechnology, Virology, Food Microbiology, Immunology, Molecular Genetics.\n3. Higher Secondary School Certificate (HSC)\nInstitute: B.A.F. Shaheen College, Tejgaon, Dhaka-1206\nSection: Science\nEXPERIENCE\nAssistant Professor, from July 2025- Present, Department of Microbiology at Gono Bishwabidyalay (University).\nLecturer, Department of Microbiology from September 2019–June 2025 at Gono Bishwabidyalay (University).\nExecutive, Microbiology, Delta Pharma Limited, June 2018–September 2019\nPublications:\nMahmudul Hasan Masud, Md Rezaul Alam, Md Aoulad Hosen , Md Shajadur Rahman, Nusrat Jahan, Md Hasibul Hasan , Raisa Rafia , Sohel Miah, Mohammad Shariful Islam and Nazmi Ara Rumi;Isolation and Identification of Common Food-borne Pathogens from Honey and Determination of Antimicrobial Activity of Honey in Greater Dhaka Region, Bangladesh;Acta Scientific MICROBIOLOGY, Volume 6 Issue 1 January 2023;DOI: 10.31080/ASMI.2022.06.1184",
