      "title": "গণ বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ে প্রোগ্রামিং কনটেস্ট অনুষ্ঠিত - Department of Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering",
      "department": "Department of Medical Physics and Biomedical Engineering",
      "type": "news",
      "publishedAt": "2024-11-19T08:06:38+00:00",
      "modifiedAt": "2024-11-27T10:36:38+00:00",
      "headings": [
