      "url": "https://gonouniversity.edu.bd/1st-convocation-of-gono-bishwabidyalay/",
      "title": "1st Convocation of Gono Bishwabidyalay - Gono Bishwabidyalay",
      "department": "1st convocation of gono bishwabidyalay",
      "type": "news",
      "publishedAt": "2024-11-17T08:33:54+00:00",
      "modifiedAt": "2024-11-17T08:33:54+00:00",
      "headings": [
        "1st Convocation of Gono Bishwabidyalay",
