      "title": "গণ বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ে প্রোগ্রামিং কনটেস্ট অনুষ্ঠিত - Department of Computer Science and Engineering (CSE)",
      "department": "Department of Computer Science and Engineering (CSE)",
      "type": "news",
