        "Approved BY",
        "Quick Links",
        "Notices",
        "Contact Us"
      ],
      "chunks": [
        "Department of C.S.E. in GONO BISHWABIDYALAY is the name of the destination of hundreds of youth, who wants to be the part of the leadership of the next era. It’s now clear that our world is becoming more digitalized day by day. So, nothing can run properly without computerized system.Department of C.S.E. in GONO BISHWABIDYALAY providing its students with the latest and modern education facilities.\nHere we became familiar with the latest technologies of the world.It is one of the best places in this country for the special kind of “Day dreamers”. This kind of day dreams is both realistic and logical. Through the qualified and highly educated and experienced teachers this department has already created a huge number of qualified engineers and also performing it’s best to create more engineers everyday, who will be a noticeable part of the leadership of the new digitalized world. In one word you can say it is one of those manufacturing house of such kind of technicians, who will maintain the best technology in future."
      ]
    },
