        "Profile\nMd. Abu Rayhan\nLecturer\nQualification: MSc. (JU)\nMobile: 01723-777058\nE-mail: rayhanbmb.ju42@gmail.com, rayhan@gonouniversity.edu.bd\nShort Biography\nEducation\nExperiences\nAdministrative Services\nPublications\nGrants\nEditorial Board/Reviewer\nConferences\nTraining\nMembership\nAwards and Achievements\nMd. Abu Rayhan is currently working as Lecturer of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology at Bono University. He was a former Scientist, R & D at ENZA Bioscience. Prior to starting his career as a scientist, he worked as a Research Assistant in the Laboratory of Lipid research and Exercise Biochemistry, Jahangirnagar University from 2018-2020. Now, he is looking for acquiring more knowledge on toxicology, early diagnosis, and treatment of disease using nanotechnology.\nMaster of Science (MSc)\nGPA: 3.80\nDepartment of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology\nJahangirnagar University, Savar, Dhaka- 1342.\nBachelor of Science (B.Sc.)\nGPA: 3.85\nLecturer\nDept. of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology\nGono Bishwabidyalay\nNolam, Mirzanagar, Savar, Dhaka, Bangladesh-1344 | 01/06/2024-present\nAssistant Lecturer\nDept. of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology\nGono Bishwabidyalay",
